ART_WIDGET&quot;'-8fe1e5b0e47812afEND_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-2bb78cb88a883e66END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UNI_BOOK_LOW_SerialKiller_DoppelgangerReports_PlayerAssassin</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_BOOK_LOW_SerialKiller_DoppelgangerReports_PlayerAssassin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_BOOK_LOW_SerialKiller_DoppelgangerReports_PlayerAssassin\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">0f5bc3eb-b91e-445c-b33b-be0bc32b3bde</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:0f5bc3eb-b91e-445c-b33b-be0bc32b3bde\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:0f5bc3eb-b91e-445c-b33b-be0bc32b3bde\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Olfaith_Olumssdottir\" title=\"Olfaith Olumssdottir\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/eb/Portrait_Olfaith_Olumssdottir.png/25px-Portrait_Olfaith_Olumssdottir.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/eb/Portrait_Olfaith_Olumssdottir.png/38px-Portrait_Olfaith_Olumssdottir.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/eb/Portrait_Olfaith_Olumssdottir.png/50px-Portrait_Olfaith_Olumssdottir.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Olfaith Olumssdottir\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/eb/Portrait_Olfaith_Olumssdottir.png/25px-Portrait_Olfaith_Olumssdottir.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/eb/Portrait_Olfaith_Olumssdottir.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Olfaith_Olumssdottir\" title=\"Olfaith Olumssdottir\">Olfaith Olumssdottir</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Field alert to the Murder Tribunal - this agent must report the activities of a new aspirant for <a href=\"/wiki/Unholy_Assassin\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Unholy Assassin\">Unholy Assassin</a>, a candidate who, though unexpected, may prove to be an outstanding exemplar of <a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal\" title=\"Bhaal\">Bhaalist</a> murder. However, this aspirant, an adventurer newly arrived in the city, is an outsider to our ranks and may require some guidance. It's not clear, for example, that the candidate knows to bring their murder evidence to the <a href=\"/wiki/Candulhallow%27s_Tombstones\" title=\"Candulhallow's Tombstones\">Tombstone Shop</a> for trial and confirmation by the Tribunal.\n</p><p><br>\n- Shallar Overseer\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This note is incorrectly labelled as a book in-game, the quote is a generic book one, and reading the note opens a book UI. Nevertheless, the icon and image display a note.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714204031\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.051 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.053 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1606/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 29239/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8529/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 935788/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   43.118      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   43.118      1 -total\n 48.05%   20.717      7 Template:Icon_text\n 41.70%   17.980     17 Template:Trim\n 21.20%    9.141      2 Template:Uid\n 20.09%    8.661      1 Template:Main_only\n 12.75%    5.497      2 Template:Template_style\n 12.53%    5.404      2 Template:Icon_link\n 10.01%    4.318      1 Template:Notes\n  9.58%    4.131      7 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:35712-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714204031 and revision id 388285. Rendering was triggered because: diff-page\n -->\n</div>"}